Description: Add CEF resources dependency to about_ui BUILD.gn
 The CEF patch chrome_browser_webui_license.patch adds an include for
 "cef/grit/cef_resources.h" to chrome/browser/ui/webui/about/about_ui.cc
 but doesn't add the corresponding GN dependency. This causes a build
 failure when ninja tries to compile about_ui.cc before cef_resources.h
 is generated.
 .
 This patch adds //cef:cef_resources to the deps list in BUILD.gn to ensure
 proper build order. Required for Chromium 144.0.7559.96 compatibility.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <juan.mendezr@proton.me>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-01-23

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/about/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/about/BUILD.gn
index e5d9b02..076a2d1 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/about/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/about/BUILD.gn
@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ source_set("impl") {

   deps = [
     ":about",
+    "//cef:cef_resources",
     "//chrome/browser:browser_process",
     "//chrome/browser:flags",
     "//chrome/browser/profiles:profile",
